---
/**
 * §4 "What the model really sees": the chat as the app shows it, next to the
 * one document the model actually reads (system prompt, special tokens,
 * real o200k_base token IDs). Generate a reply and watch it being appended
 * to that document, token by token, until <|im_end|>. Switch the template
 * off to see the base-model habit: it just continues the text.
 * English and Polish.
 */
import { langOf } from '../i18n/ui';
const lang = langOf(Astro);

const copy = {
	en: {
		kicker: 'What the model really sees',
		you: 'What you see', model: 'What the model reads',
		hidden: 'The app’s system prompt is hidden from you.',
		msg: 'Your message', presets: 'Try:',
		gen: '▶ Generate the reply', again: '↺ Reset',
		template: 'Chat template', templateOn: 'Assistant: with chat template', templateOff: 'Base model: no template',
		ids: 'Show token IDs',
		count: 'Your message: <b>{a}</b> tokens · the model reads: <b>{b}</b> tokens',
		loading: 'Loading the tokenizer…',
		stop: '<code>&lt;|im_end|&gt;</code>: the app stops reading here and shows the bubble.',
		nostop: 'No end marker: a base model would keep going until a length limit.',
		system: 'You are a helpful assistant. Answer briefly. Today is {date}.',
		moralOn: 'There is no chat inside the model. The app turns the conversation into <b>one document</b> with special tokens, and the model continues it. The reply is just the most likely continuation after <code>assistant</code>, in the style it learned from example conversations in fine-tuning.',
		moralOff: 'Without the template, the same text is just the start of a document. The model does what pre-training taught it: <b>continue the document</b>. It does not answer, because nothing tells it that a reply is expected.',
		note: 'Token IDs: GPT-4o’s o200k_base vocabulary. Special tokens follow the chat format used by the open-source gpt-tokenizer library; the exact formats of hosted models are not fully public. Replies are illustrative.',
		items: [
			{ user: 'What is the best way to track mood after surgery?', reply: 'A short daily self-report works well: one score and an optional note, at the same time each day. Your care team can tell you what to record.', base: '\nWhat is the best way to track pain after surgery?\nWhat is the best way to track sleep after surgery?\nAsked 3 years ago, 12 answers' },
			{ user: 'Write a haiku about unit tests.', reply: 'Green bars at midnight /\nthe code I feared to refactor /\nnow sleeps without dreams.', base: '\n\nWrite a haiku about integration tests.\nWrite a haiku about code review.\n\nPosted in a writing prompts forum' },
			{ user: 'Hi!', reply: 'Hi! How can I help you today?', base: ' I’m new here and I have a question about my Flutter app. When I run flutter test I get' },
		],
		custom: { reply: 'Good question. Here is what I would suggest, step by step:', base: '\n\nI have the same question. Did anyone find an answer?' },
	},
	pl: {
		kicker: 'Co naprawdę widzi model',
		you: 'Co widzisz ty', model: 'Co czyta model',
		hidden: 'System prompt aplikacji jest przed tobą ukryty.',
		msg: 'Twoja wiadomość', presets: 'Spróbuj:',
		gen: '▶ Wygeneruj odpowiedź', again: '↺ Od nowa',
		template: 'Szablon czatu', templateOn: 'Asystent: z szablonem czatu', templateOff: 'Model bazowy: bez szablonu',
		ids: 'Pokaż ID tokenów',
		count: 'Tokeny w twojej wiadomości: <b>{a}</b> · tokeny, które czyta model: <b>{b}</b>',
		loading: 'Ładuję tokenizer…',
		stop: '<code>&lt;|im_end|&gt;</code>: tu aplikacja przestaje czytać i pokazuje dymek.',
		nostop: 'Brak znacznika końca: model bazowy pisałby dalej, aż do limitu długości.',
		system: 'You are a helpful assistant. Answer briefly. Today is {date}.',
		moralOn: 'W modelu nie ma żadnego czatu. Aplikacja zamienia rozmowę w <b>jeden dokument</b> ze specjalnymi tokenami, a model go kontynuuje. Odpowiedź to po prostu najbardziej prawdopodobny ciąg dalszy po <code>assistant</code>, w stylu wyuczonym z przykładowych rozmów podczas fine-tuningu.',
		moralOff: 'Bez szablonu ten sam tekst to zwykły początek dokumentu. Model robi to, czego nauczył go pre-training: <b>kontynuuje dokument</b>. Nie odpowiada, bo nic nie wskazuje, że ktoś czeka na odpowiedź.',
		note: 'ID tokenów: słownik o200k_base modelu GPT-4o. Tokeny specjalne zgodne z formatem czatu z otwartej biblioteki gpt-tokenizer; dokładne formaty modeli dostępnych w chmurze nie są w pełni publiczne. Odpowiedzi są przykładowe.',
		items: [
			{ user: 'Jak najlepiej śledzić nastrój po operacji?', reply: 'Dobrze sprawdza się krótki wpis raz dziennie, zawsze o tej samej porze: jedna ocena i opcjonalna notatka. Zespół leczący powie ci, co warto zapisywać.', base: '\nJak najlepiej śledzić ból po operacji?\nJak najlepiej śledzić sen po operacji?\nPytanie sprzed 3 lat, 12 odpowiedzi' },
			{ user: 'Napisz haiku o testach jednostkowych.', reply: 'Zielone paski /\nkod, którego się bałem, /\nśpi dziś spokojnie.', base: '\n\nNapisz haiku o testach integracyjnych.\nNapisz haiku o code review.\n\nWątek na forum o pisaniu' },
			{ user: 'Cześć!', reply: 'Cześć! W czym mogę pomóc?', base: ' Jestem tu nowy i mam pytanie o moją aplikację we Flutterze. Kiedy uruchamiam flutter test, dostaję' },
		],
		custom: { reply: 'Dobre pytanie. Oto, co proponuję, krok po kroku:', base: '\n\nMam to samo pytanie. Ktoś znalazł odpowiedź?' },
	},
}[lang];
---

<div class="biz-widget chatt not-content" data-copy={JSON.stringify(copy)}>
	<div class="biz-head">
		<p class="biz-kicker">{copy.kicker}</p>
		<div class="llmflow__mode" role="group" aria-label={copy.template}>
			<button type="button" class="llmflow__mode-btn is-on" data-tpl="on">{copy.templateOn}</button>
			<button type="button" class="llmflow__mode-btn" data-tpl="off">{copy.templateOff}</button>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="chatt__input">
		<label>
			<span>{copy.msg}</span>
			<input type="text" value={copy.items[0].user} maxlength="160" />
		</label>
		<div class="chatt__presets">
			<span class="sdlc-legend__hint">{copy.presets}</span>
			{copy.items.map((it, k) => <button type="button" class="chatt__preset" data-i={k}>{it.user}</button>)}
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="chatt__grid">
		<div class="chatt__pane chatt__app">
			<p class="chatt__label">📱 {copy.you}</p>
			<p class="chatt__hidden">🔒 {copy.hidden}</p>
			<div class="chatt__bubbles"></div>
		</div>
		<div class="chatt__pane chatt__doc">
			<p class="chatt__label">🧠 {copy.model} <label class="chatt__ids"><input type="checkbox" /> {copy.ids}</label></p>
			<div class="chatt__tokens" aria-live="polite"><span class="chatt__loading">{copy.loading}</span></div>
			<p class="chatt__end"></p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="chatt__bar">
		<button type="button" class="sdlc-btn sdlc-btn--primary" data-act="gen">{copy.gen}</button>
		<button type="button" class="sdlc-btn" data-act="reset">{copy.again}</button>
		<span class="chatt__count"></span>
	</div>
	<p class="chatt__moral"></p>
	<p class="chatt__note">{copy.note}</p>
</div>

<script>
	type Enc = { encode: (s: string) => number[]; decode: (t: number[]) => string };
	const reduce = window.matchMedia?.('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
	let encP: Promise<Enc> | null = null;
	const loadEnc = () => (encP ??= import('gpt-tokenizer/encoding/o200k_base') as Promise<Enc>);

	document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.chatt').forEach((box) => {
		const C = JSON.parse(box.dataset.copy || '{}');
		const input = box.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('.chatt__input input')!;
		const bubbles = box.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.chatt__bubbles')!;
		const toks = box.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.chatt__tokens')!;
		const end = box.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.chatt__end')!;
		const count = box.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.chatt__count')!;
		const moral = box.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.chatt__moral')!;
		const ids = box.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('.chatt__ids input')!;
		const genBtn = box.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-act="gen"]')!;
		const date = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);
		const system = String(C.system).replace('{date}', date);
		let tpl = true;
		let enc: Enc | null = null;
		let run = 0;

		const show = (t: string) => t.replace(/ /g, '·').replace(/\n/g, '⏎');
		const chip = (text: string, id: number | null, cls = '') => {
			const s = document.createElement('span');
			s.className = 'chatt__tok ' + cls;
			s.innerHTML = '<span></span><small></small>';
			s.firstElementChild!.textContent = show(text);
			s.lastElementChild!.textContent = id === null ? '' : String(id);
			return s;
		};
		const special = (name: string) => chip(`<|${name}|>`, null, 'is-special');
		const addText = (text: string, cls = '') => {
			const out: HTMLElement[] = [];
			enc!.encode(text).forEach((id) => {
				const c = chip(enc!.decode([id]), id, cls);
				toks.appendChild(c);
				out.push(c);
			});
			return out.length;
		};
		const turn = (role: string, content: string, cls: string) => {
			toks.appendChild(special('im_start'));
			addText(role, 'is-role');
			toks.appendChild(special('im_sep'));
			addText(content, cls);
			toks.appendChild(special('im_end'));
		};
		const reply = () => {
			const k = C.items.findIndex((it: any) => it.user === input.value.trim());
			const src = k >= 0 ? C.items[k] : C.custom;
			return tpl ? src.reply : src.base;
		};
		const bubble = (cls: string, text: string) => {
			const b = document.createElement('p');
			b.className = 'chatt__bubble ' + cls;
			b.textContent = text;
			bubbles.appendChild(b);
			return b;
		};
		const build = () => {
			if (!enc) return;
			run++;
			toks.textContent = '';
			bubbles.textContent = '';
			end.innerHTML = '';
			const msg = input.value.trim() || '…';
			let userCount = enc.encode(msg).length;
			if (tpl) {
				turn('system', system, 'is-system');
				turn('user', msg, 'is-user');
				toks.appendChild(special('im_start'));
				addText('assistant', 'is-role');
				toks.appendChild(special('im_sep'));
			} else {
				addText(msg, 'is-user');
			}
			const cursor = document.createElement('span');
			cursor.className = 'chatt__cursor';
			toks.appendChild(cursor);
			bubble('is-user', msg);
			const total = toks.querySelectorAll('.chatt__tok').length;
			count.innerHTML = String(C.count).replace('{a}', String(userCount)).replace('{b}', String(total));
			moral.innerHTML = tpl ? C.moralOn : C.moralOff;
			box.classList.toggle('is-base', !tpl);
			genBtn.disabled = false;
		};
		const generate = () => {
			if (!enc) return;
			build();
			genBtn.disabled = true;
			const my = run;
			const text = reply();
			const ts = enc.encode(text);
			const cursor = toks.querySelector('.chatt__cursor')!;
			const b = bubble('is-bot' + (tpl ? '' : ' is-base'), '');
			let i = 0;
			const step = () => {
				if (my !== run) return;
				if (i < ts.length) {
					const piece = enc!.decode([ts[i]]);
					toks.insertBefore(chip(piece, ts[i], 'is-gen is-new'), cursor);
					b.textContent += piece;
					i++;
					reduce ? step() : setTimeout(step, 70);
					return;
				}
				if (tpl) {
					toks.insertBefore(special('im_end'), cursor);
					end.innerHTML = C.stop;
				} else end.innerHTML = C.nostop;
				cursor.remove();
				const total = toks.querySelectorAll('.chatt__tok').length;
				count.innerHTML = String(C.count).replace('{a}', String(enc!.encode(input.value.trim()).length)).replace('{b}', String(total));
			};
			step();
		};

		ids.addEventListener('change', () => box.classList.toggle('show-ids', ids.checked));
		input.addEventListener('input', build);
		box.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.chatt__preset').forEach((b) =>
			b.addEventListener('click', () => { input.value = C.items[Number(b.dataset.i)].user; build(); }),
		);
		box.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-tpl]').forEach((b) =>
			b.addEventListener('click', () => {
				tpl = b.dataset.tpl === 'on';
				box.querySelectorAll('[data-tpl]').forEach((x) => x.classList.toggle('is-on', x === b));
				build();
			}),
		);
		genBtn.addEventListener('click', generate);
		box.querySelector('[data-act="reset"]')!.addEventListener('click', build);

		const io = new IntersectionObserver((es) => {
			if (!es.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) return;
			io.disconnect();
			loadEnc().then((e) => { enc = e; build(); });
		}, { rootMargin: '400px' });
		io.observe(box);
	});
</script>
